Description: Compute Psa and Csv for item sorts (Anderson & Gerbing, 1991), 
an ANOVA/Tukey approach for rating studies (Hinkin & Tracey, 1999), and classic indices 
(Aiken’s V, CVR, CVI, IOC), with diagnostics and small power simulators.
